{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30289","headline":"句 · 薛逢","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草荒留客院，泥卧喂生台。\n碧碎鸳鸯瓦，香埋菡萏罏。\n初日晖晖上彩旄。\n金鞍俯鞚尘开处，银镝离弦中处声。\n昨日鸿毛万钧重，今朝山岳一朝轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}